{"parse": {"title": "Relic Shards", "pageid": 2831, "revid": 40597, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/b/b1/Relic_Shard..webp/revision/latest?cb=20230331064050\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Relic Shard.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/b/b1/Relic_Shard..webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20230331064050\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Relic Shard..webp\" data-image-key=\"Relic_Shard..webp\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Relic_Shard..webp\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Relic Shards are a rare material used to craft <a href=\"/wiki/Relics\" title=\"Relics\">Relics</a>.\n</p><p>They can currently only be obtained from the newest <a href=\"/wiki/Raids\" title=\"Raids\">raid</a> stages. These are:\n</p><p>Sacred Planet Stage 4 (The Genie) (10% Chance), and Sacred Planet Stage 5 (The Pure Form) (Guaranteed).\n</p><p>They are currently used to craft the <a href=\"/wiki/Relics\" title=\"Relics\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(0, #76f1ff 30%, #fe56ff 50%, #ffec62 60%, #fe56ff 77%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Mangekyō Eye</span></a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Relics\" title=\"Relics\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(0, #76f1ff 30%, #fe56ff 50%, #ffec62 60%, #fe56ff 77%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Mirrorblade</span></a>, and the <a href=\"/wiki/Relics\" title=\"Relics\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(0, #76f1ff 30%, #fe56ff 50%, #ffec62 60%, #fe56ff 77%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Endless Blades</span></a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>They also appear to be very similar to <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://cookierunkingdom.fandom.com/wiki/Sugar_Crystals\">Cookie Run: Kingdom's \"Purity Crystals\"</a>.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261021201919\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 11/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_animeadventures853:pcache:idhash:2831-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261021201919 and revision id 40597. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>", "images": ["Relic_Shard..webp"], "sections": [{"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Trivia", "number": "1", "index": "1", "fromtitle": "Relic_Shards", "byteoffset": 1061, "anchor": "Trivia", "linkAnchor": "Trivia"}], "showtoc": false, "displaytitle": "<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Relic Shards</span>"}, "_provenance": {"url": "https://animeadventures.fandom.com/api.php?action=parse&oldid=40597&prop=text%7Cimages%7Csections%7Cdisplaytitle&format=json&formatversion=2&disableeditsection=1", "fetched_at": "2026-10-23T13:48:23.329191+00:00", "sha256": "a69e624a7cdd955544d397c5b8643fafcedabcb4049997dfa4b12b21c9dd0049"}}